  "description": "A powerful avatar of nature personified, Orochi originally gave its power to eight chosen followers in order to enforce its will around the world. But as mankind's evolution began to affect the natural environment, Orochi saw that allowing it to exist was a mistake. It began a campaign to eradicate mankind from the world, but was sealed away by three families after a mighty battle. Its power could not be contained forever, though - and its chosen servants always worked towards its eventual return, no matter where or when they found themselves. After many years had passed, it sensed that its time was soon at hand.",
